  "instructions": [
    "heat the oil in a large non-stick pan over medium heat,then add the onion and cook until softened about 8 minutes",
    "add the garlic and cook for a further minute until fragrant",
    "add the potatoes and cook for 5 minutes,then mash slightly with a potato masher",
    "add the bhuna curry paste and mix well",
    "add the caraway seeds and cook for a final minute",
    "use a spatula to break up the potatoes into jagged pieces and serve hot",
    "note:for a more authentic german experience serve with a side of sauerkraut",
    "note:adjust the quantity of bhuna curry paste to your desired level of spiciness"
